  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Conflict awareness project (CAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Conflict Awareness Project (CAP) has the main goal of developing strategies and tools with NMS&#x2019;s partners in three African countries concerning how to prevent and handle conflicts. The main goal is to increase the churches&#x2019; resilience in contexts affected by conflict. Relevant topics and tools include conflict sensitivity (Do No Harm), conflict management (Reflecting on Peace Practices) and conflict transformation (Facilitative Mitigation).</narrative>
  </description>
